  npcName: Laira
  npcPotrait: {fileID: 21300000, guid: 6b884227d0faa094ca1e1b33fea21d07, type: 3}
  dialogueLines:
  - "Oh\u2026 you\u2019re not from here, are you?\u201D"
  - "I can tell by the way you walk \u2014 like someone who hasn\u2019t learned to
    fear the desert yet."
  - My name is Laira. I live here, among these old stones and older secrets.
  - This place may look peaceful, but the sand remembers things people wish to forget.
  - "I\u2019ve seen you wandering near the ruins\u2026 the ones with the cracked
    pillars and the silent statues."
  - Be careful there. The wind carries more than just dust at night.
